    "summary": "Battle Tactic, 1 CP, in your own [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after one of your VANGUARD INVADER units picks its targets; that unit is the target. Choose one enemy unit it is aiming at, which then has to test for [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock). Until the phase ends, your unit's attacks against it get +1 to [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), and +1 to [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) as well if the test was failed.",
